request.description:
Get platform-wide usage metrics from materialized view.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "active_orgs": 42,
    "issues_opened": 156,
    "guided_fix_rate": 67,
    "avg_response_time": 15,
    "top_orgs": [
      {
        "org_name": "Acme Corp",
        "issues_opened": 45,
        "guided_fixes_completed": 32,
        "completion_rate": 71
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Empty State:**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "active_orgs": 0,
    "issues_opened": 0,
    "guided_fix_rate": 0,
    "avg_response_time": 0,
    "top_orgs": []
  },
  "message": "No usage data yet. Analytics will populate as tickets are created."
}
```

